WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.477
This slide brings Module 12 together.

00:00:02.477 --> 00:00:05.877
Review the patterns you can now recognize and reuse.

00:00:05.877 --> 00:00:11.282
Focus on the decisions behind the syntax: what structure or method fits the problem,

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:15.992
what assumptions are being made, and what you should check before trusting the result.

00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:20.052
Do not treat cleaning as automatic deletion or filling.

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:25.937
Measure the problem first, decide what the value means, apply a defensible rule,

00:00:25.937 --> 00:00:28.157
and then validate the data again.

00:00:28.157 --> 00:00:33.917
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:39.334
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
